# python.org: type in the search box, press Enter; the search page gets the query in its url and keeps it in the box, and lists results.
#   bare-drive --var URL=https://www.python.org/ python-org-search.steps
# known-bug: main-min.js calls $.getJSON and $.ajax on other origins (console.python.org, statuspage.io), which is Fatal Unsupported (CORS is a gate) and stops the page, and the load handler reads getComputedStyle(body, ':after'), which is Unsupported; with both made per-task the journey passes; see docs/progress.md, section A script limit ends only its task
timeout 30000
open ${URL}
expect css="input#id-search-field" visible
expect js "document.readyState !== 'loading'"
type css="input#id-search-field" "asyncio\n"
expect url~"/search/?q=asyncio"
expect js "document.querySelector('input#id-search-field').value === 'asyncio'"
expect js "document.querySelectorAll('ul.list-recent-events > li').length > 5"
